{"version":"activity-event.v1","id":"AEV-260911-15b282f2b1458bb5d5cbdcb2","sequence":11,"timestamp":"2026-09-11T12:41:09.995621Z","actor":{"principal":{"availability":"unknown"},"agent":{"availability":"known","value":"claude"},"run":{"availability":"unknown"},"session":{"availability":"known","value":"26329e02-a919-421b-9117-91577a74a713"},"operator":{"availability":"unknown"}},"subject":{"element_id":"STORY-260508-1ajnbe","element_type":"story"},"source":{"kind":"local_cli","entrypoint":"cmd.runMutate","request":{"availability":"unknown"}},"correlation_id":"COR-260911-c8679dd3b4e7d71314f37310","causal_order":1,"operation":"progress","changes":[{"field":"notes","before":{"kind":"text","text":"Decision: implementation belongs in tools/agents-infra CLI, specifically setup global/local plus refresh-links. .agents is source/common install tree, not the runtime contract for Codex. Current Codex 0.128.0 treats @~/.agents/... lines literally in prompt-input, so Codex must receive flattened/materialized AGENTS.md.\nImplemented in tools/agents-infra. setup global/local and refresh-links now render Codex AGENTS.md files instead of symlinking to @include indexes. Local setup also renders project-root AGENTS.md for Codex project-doc discovery and preserves the previous hand-written source as .agents/.instructions/AGENTS.project.md. Verified go test ./..., ./setup.sh, agents-infra doctor global/local, and codex debug prompt-input with no raw @*.md include lines.\nFollow-up included runtime hygiene: setup now skips .task-board/task-board.config.json from syncRepo and cleanup removes stale board artifacts from installed ~/.agents. Verified ~/.agents has no board artifacts after final ./setup.sh."},"after":{"kind":"text","text":"Decision: implementation belongs in tools/agents-infra CLI, specifically setup global/local plus refresh-links. .agents is source/common install tree, not the runtime contract for Codex. Current Codex 0.128.0 treats @~/.agents/... lines literally in prompt-input, so Codex must receive flattened/materialized AGENTS.md.\nImplemented in tools/agents-infra. setup global/local and refresh-links now render Codex AGENTS.md files instead of symlinking to @include indexes. Local setup also renders project-root AGENTS.md for Codex project-doc discovery and preserves the previous hand-written source as .agents/.instructions/AGENTS.project.md. Verified go test ./..., ./setup.sh, agents-infra doctor global/local, and codex debug prompt-input with no raw @*.md include lines.\nFollow-up included runtime hygiene: setup now skips .task-board/task-board.config.json from syncRepo and cleanup removes stale board artifacts from installed ~/.agents. Verified ~/.agents has no board artifacts after final ./setup.sh.\n2026-09-11 goal audit: all children landed on main; done."}}]}
